      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHO'S IN DEV (4) returned from a 24-week spell and missed the placings for the first time in nine career runs when beaten just under three lengths at $1.95 over 1420m at this track last start. On-pacer with a strong record at this trip so he should make amends straight away. COOL HEART (3) doesn't win out of turn but has an impressive top three strike rate over a long period. Last raced a month ago when nailed on the line over 1350m at Devonport Synthetic. Placed eight on nine over this distance and loves Launceston. Has the right credentials to take this out. MATERIAL MADAM (6) hasn't been too flash in her two runs this time in work but she generally improves at this stage of the preparation. STREET DIVA (2) caught the eye here first-up over 1100m and should enjoy the extra 100m this evening. GEEGEES DOWNPOUR (5) resumes. Usually needs a run to hit his straps but opens this prep with blinkers on for the first time which might be significant.",
